ger with golden nectar is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":256.94,"y":761.84,"cell":3820,"i":9,"name":"The Friendly Inn","note":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious smoked pottage with bitter sap is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1625.9,"y":447.28,"cell":2068,"i":10,"name":"The Golden Camel","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled catfish with smelly gin is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f37b","type":"inns","px":14,"x":1276.85,"y":295.24,"cell":986,"i":11,"name":"The Sunny Tavern","note":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dry-aged bread with amber beer is served here."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":767.58,"y":781.8,"cell":3968,"i":12,"name":"Galed Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a8","type":"lighthouses","px":14,"x":991.8,"y":257.28,"cell":776,"i":13,"name":"Cituphan Lighthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-27f1","type":"waterfalls","dy":54,"px":16,"x":652.98,"y":612.88,"cell":3046,"i":14,"name":"Korkrunese Waterfall","note":"The cascades of a stunning waterfall."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":557.83,"y":571.8,"cell":2795,"i":15,"name":"Shatharb Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Ulbunabuan Intervention. \r\nDate: August 24, 1328 Albleton Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":1640.94,"y":248.01,"cell":749,"i":16,"name":"Shatharb Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Bat War. \r\nDate: February 4, 1417 Albleton Era."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":1633,"y":385.31,"cell":1760,"i":17,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=1813818611760\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://wa