ery sacred to local Srurdan Religion."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":204.03,"y":422.8,"cell":1950,"i":25,"name":"Bearvault Hawks","note":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":424.6,"y":628.1,"cell":3107,"i":26,"name":"Shun Jaguars","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":652.92,"y":724.46,"cell":3639,"i":27,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1478.9,"y":579.7,"cell":2821,"i":28,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":1660.54,"y":462.49,"cell":2239,"i":29,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1094.52,"y":302.58,"cell":1070,"i":30,"name":"Asargesash Idol","note":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠯᠽᢋᡞᡰᢁᢒᡯᡳᢓᡟᡡᢥᢟᠮᠧᡆᡀᢀᢐᡜᡞᡯᠩᢤᡟᡖ᠒ᢤᠮᢞ᠑ᡁᢥᠽᡲᡰᠻ᠐ᡲᢐᠰᠭᡠᡡᢏᢦᠭᢒᢜᢢᡟᠵᠩᠽᢓ᠀ᠨᡔᠿᡠᠨᢥᡓᢑᠱ᠑ᡏᠱᢜᢋᡜᡲ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1627.99,"y":133.25,"cell":212,"i":31,"name":"Thult Monolith","note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠩\udc26\udc2e\udc23\udc20\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠍\udc22\udc20\udc13\udc0d\ud802  \udc13\udc0a\udc33\udc13\ud802\ud802𐠰\ud802 \udc25\ud802 \ud802𐠂\ud802𐠮𐠫\udc37\udc33\udc0a\udc35\ud802𐠘\ud802\ud802 \udc02\ud802𐠗\ud802𐠨\ud802\ud802𐠪𐠼\udc1d\udc3f\udc26\udc1b\ud802𐠧\ud802</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1676.97,"y":258.49,"cell":838,"i":32,"name":"Ruined Sacred site","note":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":210.75,"y":777.19,"cell":3877,"i":33,"name":"Ruined Fortification","note":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":379.64,"y":310.14,"cell":1174,"i":34,"name":"Itestide Collection","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1407.86,"y":339.3,"cell":1429,"i":35,"name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":395.9,"y":738.05,"cell":3775,"i":36,"name":"Sholarag Joust","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of cunning in Sholarag, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1766.99,"y":452.12,"cell":2157,"i":37,"name":"Bamyngolgerk Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Bamyngolgerk, offering local vinegar, preserved food, and soap alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1772.12,"y":182.16,"cell":443,"i":38,"name":"Ravens migration","note":"A huge group of ravens are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1617.17,"y":355.5,"cell":1562,"i":39,"name":"Ialsirt Hole","note":"The Ialsirt Hole. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":326.1,"y":461.1,"cell":2108,"i":40,"name":"Orbur Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1478.63,"y":461.57,"cell":2216,"i":41,"name":"Erqindakh Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":703.78,"y":633.39,"cell":3123,"i":42,"name":"Unbunarg Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":601.55,"y":506.4,"cell":2454,"i":43,"name":"Narbilbibil Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1755.11,"y":463.78,"cell":2248,"i":44,"name":"Hondmaryn Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f300","type":"portals","px":14,"x":1847.19,"y":270.42,"cell":933,"i":45,"name":"Vergol Portal","note":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major cities. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"icon":"glyph-1f386","type":"rifts","x":297.42,"y":604.11,"cell":2929,"i":46,"name":"Abyssal Rift","note":"A rumoured abyssal rift in this area is causing cracks in reality itself to form."},{"icon":"glyph-1f480","type":"disturbed-burials","x":1152.93,"y":400.96,"cell":1822,"i":47,"name":"Disturbed Burial","note":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1776.63,"y":158.19,"cell":336,"i":48,"name":"Moft Tomb","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":422.2,"y":663.69,"cell":3332,"i":49,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3332\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":677.6,"y":567.7,"cell":2730,"i":50,"name"